1 polymer man 'Tubulin alpha-1A chain' 51017.320 9 3.6.5.- ? ?
;Author stated: the data processing is a non-standard procedure for microtubule-type of helical reconstruction with a seam, and it was performed around 2017 to 2019. We followed the procedure developed by Dr. Rui Zhang (R. Zhang, Cell, 2015, doi: 10.1016/j.cell.2015.07.012), with all the scripts provided by him. In this way, the generated half-maps have an applied circular mask but without touching the structural outer boundaries.
;
